    "source_text": "ここからは、日々を自分で組み立てる。\nゴールは下段の『物語を進める』——カードに出ている条件（陥落度など）を満たせば、物語の続きが始まる。\nそのために、昼に稼ぎ、夜に堕とす。",
    "file_id": "game/island_hub.rpy",
    "context": "Python Data / String [archive: archive.rpa]",
    "reference": "From here on, you organize each day yourself.\nThe goal is 'Advance Story' at the bottom—satisfying card conditions (such as corruption) begins the next part of the story.\nTo that end, earn by day and corrupt by night.",
