    "file_id": "game/island_hub.rpy",
    "context": "Python Data / String [archive: archive.rpa]",
    "reference": "[Daytime Earnings] The top 3 cards.\n'Explore' is the core source of fruit, materials, and encounters. 'Fish' gathers food safely without combat. Fruit fuels hypnosis; food is everyone's lifeline—depleted each morning by rations for yourself and subordinated women.\n'Hunt Men' is a one-shot trap gambit. Taking them down lowers threat, reducing night raids.\nIn the deep mist, you may encounter the girls, or face ambushes by men and beasts.",
    "expected_behavior": "Preserve section headers, quotes, and multi-paragraph newlines."
